<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial' }}><Box style={{ height: 76, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1 }}>{ "读之前 · 全局路线" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>{ "先看哪个文件，再看哪个文件：一条 5 站路线" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 12 }} /><Box style={{ height: 450, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 22 }}><Box style={{ height: 190, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 190, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "01" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "Program.cs" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "入口" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 26, height: 190, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#F59E0B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "→" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 190, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "02" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "Rules / Editing" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "纯判据" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 26, height: 190, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#F59E0B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "→" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 190, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "03" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "Sqlite / 词库" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "数据" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 26, height: 190, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#F59E0B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "→" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 190, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "04" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "VbeBackend / App" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "运行时" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 26, height: 190, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#F59E0B', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "→" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 190, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>{ "05" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "SelfTest / Probes" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "验证" }</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "为什么是这个顺序" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{ "先读不依赖 Windows、不依赖 Office 的纯字符串判据，它们最好懂也最好测；等你知道「该不该弹」之后，再去读真正去碰 VBE 的那层。" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 330, background: '#1E3A8A', borderRadius: 8, padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{ "一句话记住" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#DBEAFE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{ "钩子线程快但绝不碰 COM；UI 线程慢但能读真代码。后面一半的怪设计都是这句的代价。" }</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "每一站的每一页，都会列出这个文件的全部函数、一句说明和源码行号。" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 30, left: 60, right: 60, height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "VbeComplete-CS · 逐文件精读 · 面向零基础读者" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "P04 / 87" }</Text></Box></Slide>